# koshi Web Client - Build-time configuration

# Option 1: Serverless / same-origin mode (default)
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL empty — client discovers API via /api/config
# or falls back to same-origin. Use this when hosting Web UI on the same
# origin as the koshi server (e.g. Docker standalone).

# Option 2: Client-only build pointing at a remote server
# Set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your koshi server URL. The client will skip
# /api/config lookup and call the remote API directly.
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://koshi.ryopc.org

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
